      'Single trigger that flips the bias: <b>daily close &gt; 2.84</b> — back over the Mar 30 low and the rebound top (2.825), with the failed double bottom (2.72) under it; the Nov 20 bar becomes a one-bar undercut of the base and 2.89–2.97 (the triangle’s lows / the engine floor) / 3.06–3.19 (the engine’s invalidation / the old line) are next.',
